  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "海南环岛甩掉冬天，皖南如徽州长卷，甘南浓缩青藏精华，滇西北过完云南四季，青海大环线一路视觉轰炸。五条够美，但还不是最美。第五到第一更震撼，关注我，下集马上更新#中国最美自驾路线 #中国十大最美自驾路线 #自驾游 #公路旅行",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_002792061fd566b1_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 319.739002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家公路总里程已经超过五百四十万公里，能绕地球一百多圈。可要说哪一条自驾路线最美？那争议可就大了。中国说是川藏线中国人的景观大道，有人说是青海大环线，错，真要论清美这个字，他们连前三都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最美自驾路线，有先讲第十道，第六一条比一条好看。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。海南环岛线从海口出发，走东线到三亚，再从西线绕回海口，全程六百多公里。这条路最绝的是他把整个海南岛串成了一个圈儿。东线看海，文昌的椰林，万宁的冲浪，陵水的清水湾西线看山，儋州的石花水洞，东方的榆林州，昌江的棋子湾一圈下来，热带雨林温泉海滩盐田全看了，冬天走这条线最舒服，北方零下十几度，海南二十多度，一件短袖就够了。您说这是自驾，还是把冬天甩在了身后？第九名，皖南环线从黄山出发，经洪村西地齐云山、太平湖，再回黄山，全程三百多公里这条路。最绝的是，他把徽州最好的山水和村子串成了一个圈儿。红村的越长，西地的牌坊，踏川的秋色，齐云山的丹下，太平湖的水，一路都是白墙黑瓦，马头墙青石板。您春天去油菜花铺满山坡，秋天去塔川的红叶烧红了半边天。这条路不长，但每一段都是话，您说这是自驾还是在一幅徽州长卷里慢慢翻第八名。甘南环县从兰州出发，经下河朗目四扎嘎纳，若尔盖再回兰州，全程一千多公里。这条路最绝的是他把青藏高原的精华浓缩在一个圈里。拉布棱寺世界最长的转经郎郎目四，一脚踏两省扎嘎纳石头城里的葬寨、若尔盖草原，中国最美的湿地草原、花壶黄河九曲第一湾，一路都是雪山草原寺庙经翻，海拔不高，路也好走，特别适合第一次上高原的人。您说这是自驾，还是把西藏搬到了甘肃第七名？滇西北环线从昆明出发，经大理、丽江、香格里拉、泸沽湖再回昆明，全城一千八百多公里。这条路最绝的是他把云南最好的风景全串在一起。大理的苍山洱海，丽江的玉龙雪山、香格里拉的普达措、泸沽湖的走婚桥、虎跳峡的惊涛拍岸，梅里雪山的日照金山，白水台的盖华梯田，一条环线从热带雨林走到雪山高原，从海拔五百米爬到四千米，走一趟，等于把云南的四季都过了一遍。第六名，青海大环线从西宁出发，经青海湖、茶卡盐湖、大柴、蛋、敦煌、嘉峪关、张掖、祁连山，再回西宁，全程两千多公里。这条路最绝的是他把青海和甘肃的精华串成了一个圈儿。青海湖的兰、茶卡盐湖的静、翡翠湖的绿，莫高窟的壁画、鸣沙山的骆驼，嘉峪关的城楼、七彩丹霞的彩、祁连山的雪，一路都是视觉轰炸。您开一天停一天拍一天两千多公里，走完要七八天，可每一段都值。您说这是自驾，还是在中国最后的历史和最野的风景里走了一圈儿。从第十到第六，海南环岛把冬天甩在身后，皖南环线在徽州长卷里翻甘南环线，把西藏搬到了甘肃。滇西北环线把云南四季过一遍，青海大环线，把历史和风景串成圈，可这五条还不是最美的。接下来，第五道第一，一条比一条震撼，有一条路从成都出发，走一圈，回到成都，雪山草原葬寨全都有。它是哪条，它凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 890,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1130,
      "end_ms": 5130,
      "text": "咱们国家公路总里程已经超过五百四十万公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5430,
      "end_ms": 6970,
      "text": "能绕地球一百多圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7230,
      "end_ms": 9430,
      "text": "可要说哪一条自驾路线最美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9750,
      "end_ms": 11090,
      "text": "那争议可就大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11410,
      "end_ms": 16129,
      "text": "中国说是川藏线中国人的景观大道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16350,
      "end_ms": 18570,
      "text": "有人说是青海大环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19390,
      "end_ms": 19630,
      "text": "错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19970,
      "end_ms": 21630,
      "text": "真要论清美这个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21730,
      "end_ms": 23330,
      "text": "他们连前三都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23330,
      "end_ms": 29070,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最美自驾路线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29070,
      "end_ms": 31260,
      "text": "有先讲第十道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31260,
      "end_ms": 33700,
      "text": "第六一条比一条好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 38920,
      "end_ms": 42260,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42520,
      "end_ms": 45420,
      "text": "海南环岛线从海口出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 45660,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "走东线到三亚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 49980,
      "text": "再从西线绕回海口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 50280,
      "end_ms": 51720,
      "text": "全程六百多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 52200,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他把整个海南岛串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 57460,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "东线看海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58980,
      "end_ms": 60010,
      "text": "文昌的椰林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60370,
      "end_ms": 61575,
      "text": "万宁的冲浪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61910,
      "end_ms": 64455,
      "text": "陵水的清水湾西线看山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 64730,
      "end_ms": 66025,
      "text": "儋州的石花水洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66520,
      "end_ms": 67945,
      "text": "东方的榆林州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68290,
      "end_ms": 70960,
      "text": "昌江的棋子湾一圈下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71240,
      "end_ms": 76030,
      "text": "热带雨林温泉海滩盐田全看了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 76030,
      "end_ms": 78065,
      "text": "冬天走这条线最舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 78410,
      "end_ms": 79825,
      "text": "北方零下十几度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80070,
      "end_ms": 81165,
      "text": "海南二十多度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81640,
      "end_ms": 83105,
      "text": "一件短袖就够了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 83540,
      "end_ms": 84785,
      "text": "您说这是自驾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 85070,
      "end_ms": 87245,
      "text": "还是把冬天甩在了身后？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 87850,
      "end_ms": 88485,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 88850,
      "end_ms": 91295,
      "text": "皖南环线从黄山出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 91630,
      "end_ms": 94575,
      "text": "经洪村西地齐云山、太平湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 95020,
      "end_ms": 95965,
      "text": "再回黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 96360,
      "end_ms": 99150,
      "text": "全程三百多公里这条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99150,
      "end_ms": 100300,
      "text": "最绝的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100300,
      "end_ms": 104325,
      "text": "他把徽州最好的山水和村子串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 104770,
      "end_ms": 105885,
      "text": "红村的越长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106250,
      "end_ms": 107345,
      "text": "西地的牌坊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107660,
      "end_ms": 108675,
      "text": "踏川的秋色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109100,
      "end_ms": 110300,
      "text": "齐云山的丹下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 110480,
      "end_ms": 111515,
      "text": "太平湖的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 111910,
      "end_ms": 113730,
      "text": "一路都是白墙黑瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 113990,
      "end_ms": 115445,
      "text": "马头墙青石板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 116050,
      "end_ms": 119315,
      "text": "您春天去油菜花铺满山坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 119750,
      "end_ms": 123680,
      "text": "秋天去塔川的红叶烧红了半边天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 123840,
      "end_ms": 125005,
      "text": "这条路不长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 125520,
      "end_ms": 127365,
      "text": "但每一段都是话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 128160,
      "end_ms": 132355,
      "text": "您说这是自驾还是在一幅徽州长卷里慢慢翻第八名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 132530,
      "end_ms": 134870,
      "text": "甘南环县从兰州出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 135170,
      "end_ms": 138095,
      "text": "经下河朗目四扎嘎纳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 138500,
      "end_ms": 140105,
      "text": "若尔盖再回兰州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 140470,
      "end_ms": 141775,
      "text": "全程一千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 142120,
      "end_ms": 148035,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他把青藏高原的精华浓缩在一个圈里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 148540,
      "end_ms": 152675,
      "text": "拉布棱寺世界最长的转经郎郎目四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 153160,
      "end_ms": 158405,
      "text": "一脚踏两省扎嘎纳石头城里的葬寨、若尔盖草原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 159240,
      "end_ms": 164225,
      "text": "中国最美的湿地草原、花壶黄河九曲第一湾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 164540,
      "end_ms": 167985,
      "text": "一路都是雪山草原寺庙经翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 168290,
      "end_ms": 169075,
      "text": "海拔不高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 169370,
      "end_ms": 170155,
      "text": "路也好走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 170570,
      "end_ms": 173465,
      "text": "特别适合第一次上高原的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 173830,
      "end_ms": 174865,
      "text": "您说这是自驾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 175430,
      "end_ms": 178685,
      "text": "还是把西藏搬到了甘肃第七名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 179070,
      "end_ms": 181795,
      "text": "滇西北环线从昆明出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 182130,
      "end_ms": 187410,
      "text": "经大理、丽江、香格里拉、泸沽湖再回昆明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 187690,
      "end_ms": 189985,
      "text": "全城一千八百多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 191000,
      "end_ms": 196365,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他把云南最好的风景全串在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 196710,
      "end_ms": 198245,
      "text": "大理的苍山洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 198710,
      "end_ms": 208045,
      "text": "丽江的玉龙雪山、香格里拉的普达措、泸沽湖的走婚桥、虎跳峡的惊涛拍岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 208580,
      "end_ms": 210905,
      "text": "梅里雪山的日照金山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211470,
      "end_ms": 213415,
      "text": "白水台的盖华梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 214070,
      "end_ms": 218035,
      "text": "一条环线从热带雨林走到雪山高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 218660,
      "end_ms": 221635,
      "text": "从海拔五百米爬到四千米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 222510,
      "end_ms": 223275,
      "text": "走一趟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 224080,
      "end_ms": 227160,
      "text": "等于把云南的四季都过了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 227240,
      "end_ms": 227915,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 229020,
      "end_ms": 231690,
      "text": "青海大环线从西宁出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 231910,
      "end_ms": 238605,
      "text": "经青海湖、茶卡盐湖、大柴、蛋、敦煌、嘉峪关、张掖、祁连山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 239700,
      "end_ms": 240520,
      "text": "再回西宁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 240780,
      "end_ms": 242485,
      "text": "全程两千多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 243060,
      "end_ms": 248775,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他把青海和甘肃的精华串成了一个圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 249580,
      "end_ms": 253685,
      "text": "青海湖的兰、茶卡盐湖的静、翡翠湖的绿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 254130,
      "end_ms": 257345,
      "text": "莫高窟的壁画、鸣沙山的骆驼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 257860,
      "end_ms": 262905,
      "text": "嘉峪关的城楼、七彩丹霞的彩、祁连山的雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 263250,
      "end_ms": 264695,
      "text": "一路都是视觉轰炸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 265030,
      "end_ms": 268655,
      "text": "您开一天停一天拍一天两千多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 268900,
      "end_ms": 269995,
      "text": "走完要七八天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 270410,
      "end_ms": 271675,
      "text": "可每一段都值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 272190,
      "end_ms": 273505,
      "text": "您说这是自驾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 273920,
      "end_ms": 278665,
      "text": "还是在中国最后的历史和最野的风景里走了一圈儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 279130,
      "end_ms": 280525,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 280840,
      "end_ms": 283245,
      "text": "海南环岛把冬天甩在身后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 283660,
      "end_ms": 287470,
      "text": "皖南环线在徽州长卷里翻甘南环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 287670,
      "end_ms": 289525,
      "text": "把西藏搬到了甘肃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 289920,
      "end_ms": 293255,
      "text": "滇西北环线把云南四季过一遍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 293720,
      "end_ms": 294660,
      "text": "青海大环线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 294700,
      "end_ms": 296540,
      "text": "把历史和风景串成圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 297220,
      "end_ms": 299395,
      "text": "可这五条还不是最美的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 300030,
      "end_ms": 300610,
      "text": "接下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 300650,
      "end_ms": 301630,
      "text": "第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 301750,
      "end_ms": 303250,
      "text": "一条比一条震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 303630,
      "end_ms": 305930,
      "text": "有一条路从成都出发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 306430,
      "end_ms": 307070,
      "text": "走一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 307110,
      "end_ms": 308030,
      "text": "回到成都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 308050,
      "end_ms": 310950,
      "text": "雪山草原葬寨全都有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 311090,
      "end_ms": 311850,
      "text": "它是哪条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 312130,
      "end_ms": 314950,
      "text": "它凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_002792061fd566b1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 315250,
      "end_ms": 319595,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
